		{ String _name = "EBOilPressTip";							String _text = "The Oil Press produces Vegetable Oil from Kernels, Seed Oil from Pecan, or Walnut and Linseed Oil from Flax. Up to 2 Pressers can be employed to produce 18 to 24 Seed Oil from either Pecan or Walnut, produce 18 to 24 Vegetable Oil from 50 Kernels, produce 18 to 24 Linseed Oil from 50 Flax. Build Cycles: 64."; }
		
